WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.230
<i>Someone!</i>

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.100
<i>Yasuke-dono!</i>

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:08.730
<i>Is he dead?</i>

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:51.920
An insect has appeared at Minister 
Mizuno Saneyoshi-sama's mansion.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:57.000
Mizuno-sama once asked Mugai-dono 
for an insect extermination,

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:00.180
and has requested one again.

00:02:00.440 --> 00:02:01.620
What?

00:02:01.620 --> 00:02:04.070
Minister is a very important 
position in the shogunate!

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:06.890
A personal request from someone so high up...

00:02:07.410 --> 00:02:09.060
Mugai-dono is amazing!

00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:15.020
And so, since the Insect Magistrate 
normally works in pairs,

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:19.320
we'll have you go along, as well.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:24.740
Mugai-kun chose you specifically from the group.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:25.950
What?

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:32.540
Mugai-dono wants me as his partner?

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:37.970
<b>Mugai: 
What Solitary Eyes See</b>

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.580
Oharu-dono!

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:54.150
Oh, Jinbei-sama...

00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:56.360
Just listen to this—

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:06.370
I'm sorry, Oharu-dono...

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:09.690
B-Bastard, what are you doing...

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.560
...to our Oharu-chan?

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.880
Um, well...

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.810
Jinbei-sama!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:26.060
My, so you'll be Mugai-sama's partner?

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:30.090
Yes, I wanted you to be the first to know.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:38.690
Ever since I met him, I've admired him.

00:03:39.840 --> 00:03:41.700
His overwhelming power...

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:47.310
He is a star, shining in the night sky!

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:53.550
I want to be strong like he is, 
to someday repay the favor he did for me.

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:55.750
And now I have that chance!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:58.840
Congratulations, Jinbei-sama.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.520
O-Oharu-dono...

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.680
Thank you!

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:12.510
Jinbei-sama!

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:28.400
Mugai-dono!

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.840
H-H-Hello, there!

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:35.290
Th-Th-Thank you so much

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:38.040
for choosing m-m-me...

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:46.440
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, shall do everything I can

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:48.420
to meet your expectations!

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.680
Then, I'll see you there!

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.500
Listen, Mugai-kun.

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.650
I told you this yesterday,

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.990
but Jinbei-kun...

00:05:06.850 --> 00:05:08.250
Mugai-kun...

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:16.920
<b>Minister Mizuno Saneyoshi's Estate</b>

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:22.680
<i>What a splendid mansion!</i>

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:31.760
<i>The samurai here are superbly 
dressed and all look so strong!</i>

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:37.770
<i>I am honored to be here. 
And with Mugai-dono, too!</i>

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:49.210
Are you okay?

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:50.570
A samurai?

00:05:58.850 --> 00:06:00.960
That should do it.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.010
Th-Thank you for this.

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:08.590
No, a samurai's duty is 
to assist those in need.

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:10.720
Samurai-sama...

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:14.910
I am a servant here. 
My name is Yasuke.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:16.460
Yasuke-dono, is it?

00:06:16.460 --> 00:06:18.230
I am an officer with the Insect Magistrate—

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:23.400
Officer Mugai-dono has arrived 
from the Insect Magistrate!

00:06:23.930 --> 00:06:25.830
I must be going...

00:06:25.830 --> 00:06:27.990
See you around, Yasuke-dono.

00:06:28.470 --> 00:06:30.650
So he's with the Insect Magistrate.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.990
It has been a long time, Mugai-dono.

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:39.070
I haven't seen you since I asked you to exterminate the Bear Cicadas.

00:06:39.070 --> 00:06:42.540
You were splendid then.

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.340
Where is the insect?

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:47.960
Mugai-dono, don't be so rude to Saneyoshi-sama!

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.560
It's fine.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:53.240
He hasn't changed a bit.

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.430
By the way,

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.440
who is that boy with the strange expression?

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:03.280
<i>Mugai-dono is so amazing...</i>

00:07:03.280 --> 00:07:07.440
<i>Even the Minister treats him as an equal.</i>

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.650
U-Um, sir?

00:07:11.990 --> 00:07:17.200
I-I am Tsukishima Jinbei, an officer 
with the Insect Magistrate.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:20.500
I am here as Mugai-dono's partner!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.780
Oh, Mugai-dono's partner?

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:25.880
I'm glad to have you here, then.

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:27.550
Th-Thank you!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.010
<i>Mugai-dono chose me,</i>

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.720
<i>which means Mugai-dono thinks I can do this.</i>

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:37.910
<i>Okay, I'll get it done!</i>

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:43.310
Take a look, Mugai-dono.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.560
Last night,

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.080
they were attacked.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:08:01.590
It seems the insect means to 
make this mansion its nest.

00:08:07.230 --> 00:08:09.140
This is an Oohitonomi.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.650
Th-That voice!

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:21.390
This is...

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.640
<b>Oohitonomi - Giant Flea (Larva)</b>

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.450
<i>Awful...</i>

00:08:26.450 --> 00:08:27.480
I'll kill you!

00:08:30.450 --> 00:08:32.150
<i>S-So tough...</i>

00:08:36.100 --> 00:08:38.790
Tsukishima-dono, beware of that stinger.

00:08:38.790 --> 00:08:40.910
It will suck out all your blood.

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:45.110
What?

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:50.170
<i>It has a flea's jumping ability?</i>

00:08:53.320 --> 00:08:55.550
<i>I can't let it hit me!</i>

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:57.720
<i>In that case...</i>

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.340
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Splitter!</i>

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:12.580
Did you see that, Mugai-dono?

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:15.620
They're coming.

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:24.160
Wh-What?

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:31.170
I haven't seen Mugai-kun fight in a long time.

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.010
<i>The air around him changed.</i>

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:56.250
A-Amazing, Mugai-dono...

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.570
We couldn't even scratch them, 
but you dispatched them in an instant.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:03.490
Your skills are simply astonishing!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:06.600
Tsukishima-dono, you did well, also.

00:10:06.600 --> 00:10:10.110
Y-Your words honor me!

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:12.840
Anyway, that's the end of that.

00:10:13.740 --> 00:10:15.340
No, not yet.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.360
What?

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:19.120
These were all larvae.

00:10:19.660 --> 00:10:20.770
In other words...

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:32.400
<b>Oohitonomi - Giant Flea (Male)</b>

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:32.400
I-Is this a parent?

00:10:34.890 --> 00:10:36.150
There are still so many?

00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.810
Only the male?

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:40.910
S-Saneyoshi-sama!

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:43.010
Wh-What is it?

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.990
A huge flea has appeared in the kitchen, too!

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:48.900
One servant wasn't able to escape!

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:50.000
What?

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:53.960
Go save him, men!

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:57.920
B-But we can't beat them ourselves...

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:03.890
Okay!

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:06.700
Mugai-dono, you take care of these.

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.930
Leave the other to me.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.580
Y-You're going alone?

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:11.530
Naturally.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:15.720
I'll save him, even if it costs my life!

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:18.440
Mugai-dono?

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.840
You aren't strong enough.

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:22.200
Don't even try.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:26.390
<i>What?</i>

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.700
<i>What? What?!</i>

00:11:29.900 --> 00:11:33.460
I'm honored that you would worry 
over someone like me!

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:37.510
Don't worry.

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:40.580
I shall do my best to meet your expectations!

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:46.500
Stay away!

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.480
<b>Oohitonomi - Giant Flea (Female)</b>

00:11:58.690 --> 00:12:00.330
Someone!

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:09.750
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Splitter!</i>

00:12:15.900 --> 00:12:19.170
Insect Magistrate Officer, Tsukishima Jinbei,

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:22.170
is here to save you.

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.680
Samurai-sama...

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:33.280
<i>As a samurai, I must live up to 
Mugai-dono's expectations!</i>

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:48.490
<i>I didn't expect you to choose Jinbei-kun.</i>

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:52.750
<i>So you have high hopes for him, as do I.</i>

00:12:56.490 --> 00:12:57.500
<i>Hopes?</i>

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:04.190
<i>I have hopes for him?</i>

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:08.040
<i>Mugai-kun...</i>

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:21.840
W-Wow.

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.880
He took out all those insects at once.

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:31.160
Mugai-dono, will your partner who 
went to the kitchen be safe?

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:34.490
The fleas here is a male.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.170
Which means the one in the kitchen is the female.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:43.670
Isn't the female flea much larger 
and stronger than the male?

00:13:45.040 --> 00:13:46.180
It doesn't matter.

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:50.290
Tsukishima-dono is your partner, isn't he?

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:52.030
You shouldn't speak of him that way...

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:55.730
I need no partner.

00:13:57.210 --> 00:13:59.080
I defeat insects!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.320
It's my only task.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.110
That is all I am.

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:22.530
<i>This one's really tough, too...</i>

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:30.760
<i>Then I just need to smash its shell!</i>

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:35.270
<i>Strike at one point!</i>

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.820
<i>Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Strike!</i>

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:46.940
Th-The shock went through it?

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.870
W-Wow...

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.540
Insect Magistrate Officers are really strong.

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:01.130
<i>One more hit.</i>

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.380
<i>Just one more Mt. Fuji Strike!</i>

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:06.170
<i>No!</i>

00:15:07.280 --> 00:15:08.510
Yasuke-dono!

00:15:11.490 --> 00:15:12.800
Samurai-sama!

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:13.930
Watch out!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:25.230
Samurai-sama...

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:27.780
Stop...

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:36.900
I told you that I'd save you.

00:15:37.560 --> 00:15:38.750
Samurai-sama...

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:10.920
Samurai-sama!

00:16:41.830 --> 00:16:43.000
Is he dead?

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:45.290
That fool.

00:16:48.150 --> 00:16:50.350
Samurai-sama!

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:50.350
This way?

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:06.580
M-Mugai-dono, I'm sorry!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:16.840
I wasn't able to live up to your expectations!

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:20.260
I was unable to defeat the enemy...

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:24.510
I had to wait for your arrival!

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.410
I'm not worth it...

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:29.860
I-I'm not worth it!

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.700
Mugai-dono!

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:40.960
<i>H-He's...</i>

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.860
Mugai-dono...

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:48.540
I'm so... I'm so sorry!

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:51.410
<i>He's still talking about that? {D: TC - about that? Like he's still rambling on? Or like he's still talking that way? Or still talking about that time Mugai saved him?}</i>

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:01.430
Don't let it bother you, potato-boy.

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:09.520
I never had any expectations for you.

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:16.650
I won't let you escape.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.710
<i>Jingaitou: Rhino Form.</i>

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.560
Die.

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.650
Not bad...

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.710
You're as good as ever, Mugai-kun.

00:18:44.670 --> 00:18:46.810
Mugai-dono, Tsukishima-dono...

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.350
Excellent work.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.390
Th-Thank you!

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:53.060
Samurai-sama!

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.650
Yasuke-dono...

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:59.340
Thank you very much.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:01.410
I will never forget what you did for me.

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:03.420
I-It was nothing, really...

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:06.290
I didn't do anything but stand there.

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:07.960
But...

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:11.960
And a samurai's duty is 
to assist those in need.

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:29.280
<i>Tsukishima Jinbei-sama...</i>

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.750
What a nice bath...

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.250
That's...

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:02.680
Mugai-dono, what did you mean back there?

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.010
That you had no expectations for me.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.660
Just as I said.

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.270
Th-Then why?

00:20:12.640 --> 00:20:16.770
Why did you choose me for this mission?

00:20:20.670 --> 00:20:23.780
<i>Then why choose Jinbei-kun?</i>

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.280
<i>He is the weakest.</i>

00:20:27.590 --> 00:20:30.040
<i>If he dies, he will be easiest to replace.</i>

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.540
Mugai-dono!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:42.630
The reason was...

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:48.850
I've forgotten.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:50.850
Huh?

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:55.350
M-Mugai-dono...

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:58.840
I don't think th-that's really fair.

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.760
Don't tell me you forgot.

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.360
Tell me why...

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:05.230
Tell me why you chose me!

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.800
I don't really understand why,

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:16.160
but those two seem to be having fun.

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:18.580
Mugai-dono, wait...

00:21:18.580 --> 00:21:21.780
Tell me... Tell me why!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.190
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.180 --> 00:23:01.440
I'm searching for suspicious people!

00:23:01.440 --> 00:23:03.030
No one in the main room!

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:04.690
No one in the living quarters!

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:06.100
No one in the women's bath...

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:06.610
Hey!

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:07.320
No one here!

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.820
You pervert!

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:11.450
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:14.000
The Hot Guy Beneath the Mask: Nagatomimaru. {D: TC - er, is this supposed to sound kind of BL-ish?}

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>The Hot Guy Beneath the Mask: Nagatomimaru</b>
